# A touch screen is not also a mouse. Some say they are both - they have a
# mouse's buttons among what they can report - and are then given a pointer
# on the display that no hand is holding. A crew station is touched: a
# pointer is for a mouse, if one is ever plugged in.
# (The device and the node that events are read from both say what it is,
# and both are asked.)
SUBSYSTEM=="input", ENV{ID_INPUT_TOUCHSCREEN}=="1", ENV{ID_INPUT_MOUSE}=="1", ENV{ID_INPUT_MOUSE}=""
